==Battleground==
*3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 16~20 seconds<sup>480f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 4~15.33 seconds<sup>120f~460f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 21.33 seconds<sup>640f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**12 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**6 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
None of the Aku enemies here pose a significant threat, and although the Aku Gories can stack up, the first is very likely to be on fumes, if not dead before the second appears. As for Bore, the boss does have a decent chunk of HP, and can push decently, but if you have 3 meatshields, a decent crowd-controller, then [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] can take care of Bore before he and the Aku Gories can do any significant damage.

